        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Mother Mother\", \"Heartlines\"\n- People: Tracy Bonham, Broods, Lorde\n- Companies: Universal Music New Zealand\n- Charts: a chart topped by female solo artists\n- Albums: a debut studio album\n\nFacts:\n- \"Mother Mother\" was a song by female solo artist Tracy Bonham.\n- \"Mother Mother\" was the last song by a female solo artist to top the referenced chart until a later song reached number one.\n- The later song was the first release by Universal Music New Zealand for New Zealand singer Broods.\n- Broods co-wrote the song \"Heartlines\" with Lorde.\n- The later song was also released on Broods's debut studio album.",
